      "merge_commit_sha": "957ff95b89d0516855ea61ddba19224a0583c3f8",
      "body": "## Summary\n- restore an explicit persistent Not now path on the first-run prompt\n- keep Race Now and Learn the Track independently reachable, including keyboard/controller/Android back behavior\n- add a fresh-profile onboarding-to-race regression test without granting tutorial rewards\n- fix rail-speed compounding and cap AI-only stacked boosts at the evaluator contract discovered during regression\n\n## Validation\n- python content validator: PASS\n- Python unit tests: 31/31 PASS\n- full Godot headless suite: PEDESTRIAN_MAIN_GODOT_HEADLESS_PASS\n- exhaustive competitive AI matrix: 768/768 PASS, zero errors, zero cheats\n- digital RC packaging: PEDESTRIAN_DIGITAL_RC_READY\n\nPhysical-performance validation remains pending; no human gate was changed."
    },
    "3k-mlvPR9": {
      "url": "https://github.com/gunnchOS3k/3k-mlv/pull/9",
